      "statement": "reconcile_stale_runs is the durable-dispatch safety net: it paginates every `busy` thread, lists its `pending` runs, and cancels (action=interrupt) those older than max_age_seconds (default 1800s), so runs whose completion webhook never fired do not hold a thread busy forever.",
